        ("Boundary: exactly 8 characters (or 7, just outside)", ["boundary", "exactly 8", "8 characters", "7 characters", "eight"]),
        ("Erroneous: a password that should be rejected, such as 3 characters or nothing at all", ["erroneous", "empty", "blank", "3 characters", "too short", "nothing"]),
